  <h2 class="ecl-u-type-heading-2">Tutorials</h2>
</div>
<div class="ecl"><h3>How to <strong>search</strong> for a specific product model in EPREL</h3>              
<article>
  
  <div class="ecl-media-container" data-ecl-media-container="true" data-ecl-auto-init="MediaContainer"><figure class="ecl-media-container__figure"><div class="ecl-media-container__video-wrapper"><video class="ecl-video ecl-media-container__media" poster="profiles/contrib/ewcms/themes/ewcms_theme/images/default_animation_thumbnail.jpg" playsinline="" autoplay="" muted="" loop="" data-ecl-media-container-video=""><source type="video/mp4" src="https://energy-efficient-products.ec.europa.eu/system/files/2025-07/Media2.mp4"></source></video><button class="ecl-button ecl-button--tertiary ecl-button--m ecl-button--neutral ecl-media-container__play ecl-button--icon-only" type="button" data-ecl-media-container-play=""><span class="ecl-button__container"><span class="wt-icon--play-outline ecl-icon ecl-icon--m ecl-button__icon ecl-icon--play-outline" aria-hidden="true" data-ecl-icon=""></span></span></button><button class="ecl-button ecl-button--tertiary ecl-button--m ecl-button--neutral ecl-media-container__pause ecl-button--icon-only" type="button" data-ecl-media-container-pause=""><span class="ecl-button__container"><span class="wt-icon--pause-outline ecl-icon ecl-icon--m ecl-button__icon ecl-icon--pause-outline" aria-hidden="true" data-ecl-icon=""></span></span></button></div></figure></div>
  </article>
<ul><li>Welcome to this tutorial on how to search for a specific product model in EPREL</li><li>To enter EPREL, go to eprel.ec.europa.eu</li><li>Click on the specific product group, for example smartphones and tablets</li><li>With the search by function, you can use 3 options. You get more precise results by also using the filters on the left.</li><li>The displayed results show the list of the brands registered models in EPREL</li><li>Click on « more details » to view the full details of the specific model</li><li>Thank you for your attention</li></ul><p> </p><h3><strong>How to filter results in EPREL</strong></h3>              
<article>
  
  <div class="ecl-media-container" data-ecl-media-container="true" data-ecl-auto-init="MediaContainer"><figure class="ecl-media-container__figure"><div class="ecl-media-container__video-wrapper"><video class="ecl-video ecl-media-container__media" poster="profiles/contrib/ewcms/themes/ewcms_theme/images/default_animation_thumbnail.jpg" playsinline="" autoplay="" muted="" loop="" data-ecl-media-container-video=""><source type="video/mp4" src="https://energy-efficient-products.ec.europa.eu/system/files/2025-07/Media3.mp4"></source></video><button class="ecl-button ecl-button--tertiary ecl-button--m ecl-button--neutral ecl-media-container__play ecl-button--icon-only" type="button" data-ecl-media-container-play=""><span class="ecl-button__container"><span class="wt-icon--play-outline ecl-icon ecl-icon--m ecl-button__icon ecl-icon--play-outline" aria-hidden="true" data-ecl-icon=""></span></span></button><button class="ecl-button ecl-button--tertiary ecl-button--m ecl-button--neutral ecl-media-container__pause ecl-button--icon-only" type="button" data-ecl-media-container-pause=""><span class="ecl-button__container"><span class="wt-icon--pause-outline ecl-icon ecl-icon--m ecl-button__icon ecl-icon--pause-outline" aria-hidden="true" data-ecl-icon=""></span></span></button></div></figure></div>
  </article>
<ul><li>Welcome to this tutorial on how to sort results in EPREL</li><li>To enter EPREL, go to eprel.ec.europa.eu</li><li>Click on the specific product group, for example smartphones and tablets</li><li>You can sort by several options, but maximum up to 3 different criteria</li><li>Once clicked, the list is instantly updated</li><li>Thank you for your attention</li></ul></div>

      </div>

  </div>

    
  <div class="ecl-u-mb-2xl">
    <a id="paragraph_5497"></a>
      <div>
          <div class="ecl">
  <h2 class="ecl-u-type-heading-2">The Public EPREL website</h2>
</div>
<div class="ecl"><p>EPREL facilitates comparisons between different product models, enabling consumers, procurers and the business make informed choices. </p>    

<div class="ecl-media-container ecl-media-container--custom-ratio ecl-u-mb-s ewcms-embed-large" data-ecl-media-container="true" data-ecl-auto-init="MediaContainer"><figure class="ecl-media-container__figure"><div class="ecl-media-container__media"><img loading="eager" class="ecl-u-width-100 ecl-u-height-auto ecl-media-container__media--ratio-custom" srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_large/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_17_12-Greenshot.png?itok=RY77KlBN 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/embed_large_2x/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_17_12-Greenshot.png?itok=aBNuy5x0 2x" width="499" height="774" src="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_large/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_17_12-Greenshot.png?itok=RY77KlBN" alt="eprel homepage"></div></figure></div>
<p><em>This picture represents the home page of the public EPREL system.</em></p></div>

      </div>

  </div>

    
  <div class="ecl-u-mb-2xl">
    <a id="paragraph_5499"></a>
      <div>
          <div class="ecl">
  <h2 class="ecl-u-type-heading-2">How to use EPREL</h2>
</div>
<div class="ecl"><p>On the EPREL home page, you will see a map of all "product groups". A group may include several different products (e.g. the group "displays" includes TVs, monitors or signage, the group "commercial refrigerators" includes 5 types of refrigerators, from food to beverages or ice-cream, etc.).</p><p>For every product group you can:</p><ul><li>search for a specific model (by brand and model name or by registration number)</li><li>filter for all models fitting to a set of criteria (specific for every different product group)</li><li>sort the search results up to 3 simultaneous keys</li><li>analyse the "class population" for the selected models (i.e. how many models are in each class)</li></ul><p>When you examine a specific model (via the <strong>details button</strong>) you get additional information to what you see in the label. For some product groups the information is extremely detailed (e.g. for "refrigerators" or for "light sources" including even the "Spectral power distribution" graph):</p>    

<div class="ecl-media-container ecl-media-container--custom-ratio ecl-u-mb-s ewcms-embed-medium" data-ecl-media-container="true" data-ecl-auto-init="MediaContainer"><figure class="ecl-media-container__figure"><div class="ecl-media-container__media"><img loading="eager" class="ecl-u-width-100 ecl-u-height-auto ecl-media-container__media--ratio-custom" srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_19_31-Greenshot.png?itok=txDti067 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium_2x/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_19_31-Greenshot.png?itok=Is4UbyXT 2x" width="538" height="233" src="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_19_31-Greenshot.png?itok=txDti067" alt="more details button"></div></figure></div>
<p>For some product groups, whose legislation has been recently reviewed, you may find weblinks to complementary information such as list of spare parts, their indicative cost, repair instructions, or even dismantling information for recyclers.</p>    

<div class="ecl-media-container ecl-media-container--custom-ratio ecl-u-mb-s ewcms-embed-medium" data-ecl-media-container="true" data-ecl-auto-init="MediaContainer"><figure class="ecl-media-container__figure"><div class="ecl-media-container__media"><img loading="eager" class="ecl-u-width-100 ecl-u-height-auto ecl-media-container__media--ratio-custom" srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_23_36-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-01-15%2011_21_52-Greenshot.png%20-%20Greenshot%20image%20e.png?itok=p02n3vQc 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium_2x/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_23_36-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-01-15%2011_21_52-Greenshot.png%20-%20Greenshot%20image%20e.png?itok=JRxx-P20 2x" width="538" height="473" src="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_23_36-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-01-15%2011_21_52-Greenshot.png%20-%20Greenshot%20image%20e.png?itok=p02n3vQc" alt="general info"></div></figure></div>
</div>

      </div>

  </div>

    
  <div class="ecl-u-mb-2xl">
    <a id="paragraph_5500"></a>
      <div>
          <div class="ecl">
  <h2 class="ecl-u-type-heading-2">General Information</h2>
</div>
<div class="ecl"><p>In the <strong>General Information</strong> section, you will find the specific details about the product:</p>    

<div class="ecl-media-container ecl-media-container--custom-ratio ecl-u-mb-s ewcms-embed-medium" data-ecl-media-container="true" data-ecl-auto-init="MediaContainer"><figure class="ecl-media-container__figure"><div class="ecl-media-container__media"><img loading="eager" class="ecl-u-width-100 ecl-u-height-auto ecl-media-container__media--ratio-custom" srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_21_52-Greenshot.png?itok=DMXcEhpI 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium_2x/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_21_52-Greenshot.png?itok=mNb6akvC 2x" width="538" height="680" src="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_21_52-Greenshot.png?itok=DMXcEhpI" alt="general info"></div></figure></div>
</div>

      </div>

  </div>

    
  <div class="ecl-u-mb-2xl">
    <a id="paragraph_5501"></a>
      <div>
          <div class="ecl">
  <h2 class="ecl-u-type-heading-2">Product Information Sheet</h2>
</div>
<div class="ecl"><p>The <strong>Product Information Sheet</strong> is available in several languages and can be downloaded:</p>    

<div class="ecl-media-container ecl-media-container--custom-ratio ecl-u-mb-s ewcms-embed-medium" data-ecl-media-container="true" data-ecl-auto-init="MediaContainer"><figure class="ecl-media-container__figure"><div class="ecl-media-container__media"><img loading="eager" class="ecl-u-width-100 ecl-u-height-auto ecl-media-container__media--ratio-custom" srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_29_15-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-01-15%2011_23_36-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-0.png?itok=JqYPdTXF 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium_2x/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_29_15-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-01-15%2011_23_36-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-0.png?itok=ZsHXDA5P 2x" width="349" height="399" src="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_29_15-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-01-15%2011_23_36-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-0.png?itok=JqYPdTXF" alt="product info sheet"></div></figure></div>
</div>

      </div>

  </div>

    
  <div class="ecl-u-mb-2xl">
    <a id="paragraph_5505"></a>
      <div>
          <div class="ecl">
  <h2 class="ecl-u-type-heading-2">Additional Information</h2>
</div>
<div class="ecl"><p>The <strong>Additional Information </strong>section shows when the model has been placed on the Union market:</p>    

<div class="ecl-media-container ecl-media-container--custom-ratio ecl-u-mb-s ewcms-embed-medium" data-ecl-media-container="true" data-ecl-auto-init="MediaContainer"><figure class="ecl-media-container__figure"><div class="ecl-media-container__media"><img loading="eager" class="ecl-u-width-100 ecl-u-height-auto ecl-media-container__media--ratio-custom" srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_32_30-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-01-15%2011_29_15-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-0.png?itok=3Xo8Ilbr 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium_2x/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_32_30-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-01-15%2011_29_15-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-0.png?itok=g6w4mK_J 2x" width="538" height="136" src="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_32_30-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-01-15%2011_29_15-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-0.png?itok=3Xo8Ilbr" alt="additional information"></div></figure></div>
</div>

      </div>

  </div>

    
  <div class="ecl-u-mb-2xl">
    <a id="paragraph_5503"></a>
      <div>
          <div class="ecl">
  <h2 class="ecl-u-type-heading-2">Supplier Contact Information</h2>
</div>
<div class="ecl"><p>In the <strong>Supplier Contact Information</strong> section, you will find the supplier's contact details:</p>    

<div class="ecl-media-container ecl-media-container--custom-ratio ecl-u-mb-s ewcms-embed-medium" data-ecl-media-container="true" data-ecl-auto-init="MediaContainer"><figure class="ecl-media-container__figure"><div class="ecl-media-container__media"><img loading="eager" class="ecl-u-width-100 ecl-u-height-auto ecl-media-container__media--ratio-custom" srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_37_13-Greenshot.png?itok=pKCks9ei 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium_2x/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_37_13-Greenshot.png?itok=gLGuTafR 2x" width="538" height="250" src="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_37_13-Greenshot.png?itok=pKCks9ei" alt="supplier contact info"></div></figure></div>
</div>

      </div>

  </div>

    
  <div>
    <a id="paragraph_5504"></a>
      <div>
          <div class="ecl">
  <h2 class="ecl-u-type-heading-2">Report a model</h2>
</div>
<div class="ecl"><p>Finally, a specific feature (see here below) allows you to <strong>report</strong> (anonymously or providing your email address) an error in the registered data: both, the supplier and market surveillance authorities, will be notified.</p>    

<div class="ecl-media-container ecl-media-container--custom-ratio ecl-u-mb-s ewcms-embed-medium" data-ecl-media-container="true" data-ecl-auto-init="MediaContainer"><figure class="ecl-media-container__figure"><div class="ecl-media-container__media"><img loading="eager" class="ecl-u-width-100 ecl-u-height-auto ecl-media-container__media--ratio-custom" srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_39_11-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-01-15%2011_37_13-Greenshot.png%20-%20Greenshot%20image%20e.png?itok=7OotdD2m 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium_2x/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_39_11-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-01-15%2011_37_13-Greenshot.png%20-%20Greenshot%20image%20e.png?itok=bl3_vfuD 2x" width="312" height="204" src="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2026-01/2026-01-15%2011_39_11-C__Users_vinccla_Downloads_2026-01-15%2011_37_13-Greenshot.png%20-%20Greenshot%20image%20e.png?itok=7OotdD2m" alt="report this model"></div></figure></div>
    

<div class="ecl-media-container ecl-media-container--custom-ratio ecl-u-mb-s ewcms-embed-medium" data-ecl-media-container="true" data-ecl-auto-init="MediaContainer"><figure class="ecl-media-container__figure"><div class="ecl-media-container__media"><img loading="eager" class="ecl-u-width-100 ecl-u-height-auto ecl-media-container__media--ratio-custom" srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2024-10/2024-10-01%2011_37_33-EPREL%20Public%20website%20and%207%20more%20pages%20-%20Work%20-%20Microsoft%E2%80%8B%20Edge.png?itok=dy7VaE_1 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium_2x/public/2024-10/2024-10-01%2011_37_33-EPREL%20Public%20website%20and%207%20more%20pages%20-%20Work%20-%20Microsoft%E2%80%8B%20Edge.png?itok=-I_Zoq53 2x" width="538" height="366" src="/sites/default/files/styles/embed_medium/public/2024-10/2024-10-01%2011_37_33-EPREL%20Public%20website%20and%207%20more%20pages%20-%20Work%20-%20Microsoft%E2%80%8B%20Edge.png?itok=dy7VaE_1" alt="report model pop up"></div></figure></div>
</div>

      </div>

  </div>

  
  </div>
</div>

  </div>

              <div class="ewcms-page-section ecl-u-mb-2xl">
      
  <div class="ecl-container ecl-u-pv-m">
    <a id="paragraph_5493"></a>
      <div>
          <div class="ecl">
  <h2 class="ecl-u-type-heading-2">More insights</h2>
</div>
<div class="ecl"><p>EPREL is hosted by the European Commission.&nbsp;</p><p>Additional information, covering the entire Ecodesign and Energy Labelling legislative framework, is available on the <a href="https://energy-efficient-products.ec.europa.eu/"><strong>Energy Efficiency Products Portal</strong>.</a></p><ul><li>If you wish to know about the <strong>legislative aspects</strong>, you may start from visiting the specific section on the <a href="https://energy-efficient-products.ec.europa.eu/ecodesign-and-energy-label">legislative framework</a>.</li><li>If you are interested in knowing more of <strong>specific products</strong> and of the legislation covering them, you may visit the portal from the <a href="https://energy-efficient-products.ec.europa.eu/product-list">list of products in scope</a> (more coming). This section provides information potentially relevant for consumers, business purchasers, public or private procurers or related to the EU taxonomy.</li><li>If you are a <strong>manufacturer</strong> established in the EU, an authorised representative or an importer that needs to register product models you may find relevant information in the specific <a href="https://energy-efficient-products.ec.europa.eu/suppliers">section for suppliers</a>.</li><li>If you are a <strong>dealer or distributor</strong> and you need to know more about your obligations to display the energy labels or to provide information on the product (supplier, documentation, etc.), you may directly visit the <a href="https://energy-efficient-products.ec.europa.eu/dealers">section for dealers</a>.</li></ul></div>

      </div>

  </div>

    
  <div class="ecl-container ecl-u-pv-m">
    <a id="paragraph_5491"></a>
      <div>
          <div class="ecl">
  <h2 class="ecl-u-type-heading-2">Contact information</h2>
</div>
<div class="ecl"><p>A <a href="https://energy-efficient-products.ec.europa.eu/node/578/ENER-EPREL-HELPDESK@ec.europa.eu?prefLang=en"><strong><u>HELPDESK</u></strong></a> is available to assists suppliers facing <strong>technical issues</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>Another service, <span class="spamspan"><span class="u">ENER-ENERGY-LABELLING</span><img class="spamspan-image" alt="at" src="/modules/contrib/spamspan/image.gif"><span class="d">ec<span class="o"> [dot] </span>europa<span class="o"> [dot] </span>eu</span><span class="t"> (<strong><u>ENER ENERGY LABELLING</u></strong>)</span></span>, provides assistance on <strong>policy-related issues</strong> when registering the product models.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>

      </div>

  </div>

  </div>
  </div>

</article>

  </div>

            
                  </div>
      </div>
